{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:13.20.950","page_type":"section"},"citation":"13.20.950","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.20.950","content_hash":"431d0206a782a8bdbc7d91ccec4e3be3dcf9ee96ff413c7d8482b33138c4586f","heading":"Prohibited acts.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.950:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.20.950","text":"(a) In addition to any other enforcement provisions contained in this chapter, it shall be unlawful for any person to do the following:\n(1) Violate any term or condition of the grease hauler license.\n(2) Failure to follow any filing, reporting, inspection or monitoring requirement required by Federal, State, or City law or regulation.\n(3) Failure to comply with any lawful order or requirement made by the Utilities Director.\n(4) Failure to maintain accurate grease interceptor service reports.\n(5) Disposal of waste at any site other than the designated disposal site.\n(b) Any person violating this section may be punished by:\n(1) A fine of not more than $499.00;\n(2) Imprisonment in jail for not more than 179 days; or\n(3) Both such fine and imprisonment, not to exceed the limits set out in subsections (b)(1) and (b)(2) of this section. (Ord. 20089 § 100, 10-17-17.)","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"15728c00-85cf-575e-9f75-d342b7573344"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"13.20.950","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/13.20.950","content_hash":"46f331e19d8a9127524ac71ae324e09ad361a5e12b93645d8a6fff76be9fc02a","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.950:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"k